<title>BELARUS: TABLE-Belarus June industry output up 20.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belarus June industry output up 20.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial output in Belarus rose 6.9 percent in June to stand 20.5 percent higher than a year earlier, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Industrial output in the first half of this year was 13.9 percent higher than a year earlier, the ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT June 97  May 97   June 96</p>
<p>    month/month		    +6.9     -6.1     N/A</p>
<p>    year/year		     +20.5    +11.9    +3.1</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
